==Requirements==
Player must own a usable glide-trainable [[ride]] along with waiting at least one day after completion of [[Quest:Glide Training: I'm Advanced!]] in order to do [[Quest:Glide Training: License to Glide]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
==Goals==
Bounce through the fiery hoop above the launch pad in Seaside while on your untrained glide-trainable ride.
*Bounce through the Seaside hoop
*Return to Troy Ridewrangler
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
#*"The fifth and final step in training a ride how to glide is to reinforce the lessons already learned.<br />Go to the launch pads in Seaside and jump through the fiery hoop above while riding your untrained glide-trainable ride." -Troy Ridewrangler
#Bounce through the Lakeshore hoop
#*While on your ride bounce on the specific launch pad in [[Seaside]], aim for the middle of the pad.
#Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
#*"Great job! The training reinforcement has been transferred to the saddle!<br />This saddle is now complete! Use the saddle or speak to me again and we can permanently transfer this knowledge to one of your untrained glide-traininable rides.<br />Speak to me again tomorrow if you'd like to start the training process from the beginning." -Troy Ridewrangler
